in their own way, and they try to translate what difficulties older people can encounter. All that translated to clunky game mechanics.<br><br>You'll also follow a short conversation between our 2 ladies on their favourite bench, talking about what life was, what it is and what it will be.<br><br>Hope you enjoy <strong>Short memories</strong>, it was made with <strong>love</strong>!<br><br>\u2728\u2728\u2728<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189110/extras/cd37ad96fdb0795f73ff43d6c12d8312.poster.avif?t=1729500716\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189110/extras/cd37ad96fdb0795f73ff43d6c12d8312.webm?t=1729500716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189110/extras/cd37ad96fdb0795f73ff43d6c12d8312.mp4?t=1729500716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
